<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - ChiRex Inc raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - ChiRex Inc raised.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Boston said it upgraded ChiRex Inc to strong buy from buy.</p>
<p>-- Earlier on Monday, ChiRex said it agreed to buy Glaxo Wellcome Plc's GMP Pharmaceutical production facility in Annan, Scotland.</p>
<p>-- ChiRex gained two to 13-5/8.</p>
</text>
